s are the ship  and  wanda is theseus the vision is able to  unlock  whitevision's memory something he says  is not easily wiped and allows white  vision to transform from a mindless  robot to something more human  his eyes change from robotic to human to  signify this change then he's like peace  i'm out of here and we never see him  again  but we'll get more into white vision in  a bit like any good mom  wanda leaves billy and tommy in charge  of taking on all the military but as  soon as they're attacked  monica steps in and absorbs the bullets  this has to be her manifesting vision's  power not only is it the same yellow  color but being able to have objects go  through her  is exactly what vision can do and it's  possible she may have learned this while  watching the two visions fight from  ralph  or pietro's window at the beginning of  the episode wanda tries to perform one  of agnes's own tricks on her by  transporting her into the memory of the  day she was killed by her coven  this backfires when the dead witches  reanimate and call her the scarlet witch  the harbinger of chaos she blasts them  away as a scarlet crown dawns her head  fulfilling the vision she saw years ago  of a floating crowned  figure agnes gives wanda one last chance  to live pain-free in a world of her own  give me your power and i will correct  the flaws in your original spell and no  one will  ever have to feel this pain  again but wanda has one last trick up  her sleeve  she's covered the hex in protection  runes just like the one agnes had in her  basement  making any other witch butt wanda unable  to use  magic in a given space  only the witch who cast them can use her  magic  instead of killing or locking agnes up  wanda gives her what she believes to be  a worse fate  to play the role of the nosy neighbor in  west view forever  and this opens up a lot of possibilities  for us to return to west view  wanda might need agnes later on or  someone may come along and free her long  story short this is likely not the last  time we'll see  agnes i'll get you my pretty and your  little dog too  [Music]  and i killed sparky too  [Laughter]  [Music]  wand and vision both know at this point  what wanda must do  remove the hex for good and move on with  her life  i know you'll set everything right  just not for us it's a bit sad but  there's some hope here  vision has changed over the years just  like theseus's ship  who's to say he won't be back and who  knows in what form  there's also white vision now having  unlocked the memories of the past  if he has these memories are his  feelings for wanda not there as well  surely he would be looking for her but  as we'll see in a bit wanda may not  want to be found as wanda says goodbye  to her boys we finish her character arc  for this season  she started in grief unable to let go of  her family  constructing a world where she'd never  have to be in pain but this is at the  expense of others  and now she's learned to overcome her  own pain to learn that family is forever  a family is forever  we could never truly leave each other  even if we tried vision and wanda say  goodbye  he's the piece of the mind stone that  lives in her he'll always be there  even though this version of him was  created by wanda he is now  a memory made real  who knows what i might be next the show  is called  wanda vision vision isn't going anywhere  the question remains in what form he  will manifest  will it be white vision or is there  another universal reality where he still  exists more on that in a bit bonus  points if you saw the marquee playing  tanhauser gate a  location mentioned in blade runner and  also a nod to the german opera tanhauser  the story of which revolves around  redemption through love  sound familiar with wanda's  mind-controlled west view gone there's  one  final goodbye that between monica and  wanda where  wanda apologizes for all the pain she's  caused the show has never really been  about the relationship between these two  particular characters this is more of a  setup for where their characters may be  headed  outside the wandavision series wanda  tells monica  i don't understand this power  but i will which will likely be her big  arc in what season 2 will focus on if  season 1 was focused around  westview season 2 is her learning to  discover her power and unlock its  mysteries perhaps even learning how to  bring back tommy and billy  in the second post-credits scene we see  wanda in a secluded almost  norse-like location it seems as though  she doesn't want to be found  nor disturbed she's seen levitating  perhaps astral projecting  looking through the dark hold when she's  interrupted by the sounds of  tommy and billy asking for help  how can they still be alive i know a lot  of theories out there have centered  around  a multiverse and that is a possibility  magic does come from other dimensions in  the marvel universe but i can't help but  think doctor strange might be  involved here somehow maybe it's him  who's using these voices to lure wanda  out of hiding wanda's astral projecting  form here also looks similar to  strange's form when he  astral projects this allowed him to  study while his body rested wanda makes  tea while she simultaneously studies  doctor strange also oversaw 14 million  different outcomes trying to figure out  a way to destroy  thanos can wanda also use this skill for  her own gain  of course she would probably need the  time stone is there an outcome where she  can save her children  and can strange help her out elizabeth  olsen has been cast in doctor strange in  the multiverse of madness  and began filming right after  wandavision so expect her post-credit  scene to tie  into that and finally we have that other  post-credit scene where hayward is  arrested and monica is met with a skrull  agent she was sent by an old friend of  her mother's who wants to meet with her  up there this has to be nick fury who we  last saw hanging out with his skrulls in  a spaceship in the mid-credits scene of  spider-man  far from home nick met young monica  rambo and captain marvel and said she  can have adventures up in space when she  can glow  too only if you learn to glow like your  auntie carol well it looks like her time  has come and we'll be seeing more of  monica in both captain marvel 2  and nick fury's own disney plus show  secret invasion  other characters like darcy lewis and  agent wu are likely to return next  season too  they were huge fan hits with some even  calling on them to have their own  disney plus spin-off that's all for  today guys thanks for watching and  please make sure to like and subscribe  i'm always coming out with new  videos for more bad takes you can always  follow me on twitter and instagram  at thingstoryt until next time remember  daddy loves you very much
 

